          "stars": 5,
          "timeAgo": "2 months ago",
          "text": "Please don't pass up this little neighborhood shop. It's not fancy but it's not shabby either! The food coming out of the kitchen is fresh, hot and delicious. I ordered the egg white omelette with cheese and the protein pancakes and dined in but also the protein donuts for takeaway; they were amazing! No exaggeration. You smell the scent of vanilla off of the pancakes and donuts first. They are dense but that just means filling. Order fast. It's worth every dong!!",
