          "text": "The food is very healthy, with portions that are just enough to make you full without feeling heavy. The flavors are well-balanced and not too salty. Personally, I really enjoy the pan-seared salmon here — it's absolutely delicious, especially with the mushroom sauce. The dine-in price is very reasonable (better than ordering delivery through apps). A great choice for anyone who enjoys healthy eating and a well-balanced meal.",
